            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A hand? (हात, hāt.) A foot? (पाय, pāy.) Hair? (केस, kes.) A tooth? (दात, dāt.) The throat? (गळा, gaḷā.) The stomach? (पोट, poṭ.) A shoulder? (खांदा, khāndā.) A finger? (बोट, boṭ.) The neck? (मान, mān.) The face? (चेहरा, chehrā.) Blood? (रक्त, rakta.) A knee? (गुडघा, guḍghā.) The head? (डोके, ḍoke.) A fever? (ताप, tāp.) A clinic? (दवाखाना, davākhānā.) Ill? (आजारी, ājārī.) Pain? (वेदना, vedanā.) Thirst? (तहान, tahān.) Hunger? (भूक, bhūk.) Happy? (आनंदी, ānandī.) Sad? (दुःखी, duḥkhī.) A father? (वडील, vaḍīl.) A mother? (आई, āī.) A son; a boy? (मुलगा, mulgā.) A daughter; a girl? (मुलगी, mulgī.) A grandfather? (आजोबा, ājobā.) A grandmother? (आजी, ājī.) An uncle? (काका, kākā.) An aunt? (मावशी, māvshī.) An uncle? (मामा, māmā.) A husband? (नवरा, navrā.) A wife? (बायको, bāyko.) A baby? (बाळ, bāḷ.) A person? (माणूस, māṇūs.) A woman? (बाई, bāī.) A neighbour? (शेजारी, shejārī.) A guest? (पाहुणा, pāhuṇā.) A teacher? (शिक्षक, shikṣak.) To hear? (ऐकणे, aikṇe.) To get up? (उठणे, uṭhṇe.)"
            }
          ]
